    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Side Hustle City, we are happy to offer you a world with lots of real-time simulations on which will depend your success, hustle your way trough it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into the in-game trading world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a real-time simulated trading app to buy and sell fictional tickers from well-known companies across the city. Track your portfolio, analyze your ROI\u2014and be careful who you trust. NPCs may offer tips and market whispers, but some insights can shift the market, others are just noise. It\u2019s up to you to tell the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/9963d8f2ea68da319878530bb7735e05.poster.avif?t=1754682862\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/9963d8f2ea68da319878530bb7735e05.webm?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/9963d8f2ea68da319878530bb7735e05.mp4?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feeling lost or out of the loop?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChirpNet is your in-game social feed\u2014where market rumors, city gossip, and breaking news collide. Stay ahead of trends, react to events, or post your own updates. But be careful... not every chirp is the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/19f43ed06c77c42e43fa3a21fd5251b5.poster.avif?t=1754682862\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/19f43ed06c77c42e43fa3a21fd5251b5.webm?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/19f43ed06c77c42e43fa3a21fd5251b5.mp4?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talk to the locals\u2014if you dare to trust them.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every store, caf\u00e9, or street corner, characters you meet have something to say. Strike up a conversation to uncover personal stories, local gossip, or even inside info about companies. But not everything you hear is reliable\u2014some tips might help you profit, while others could lead you straight into a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/be389d4fdf8ab47a0b0fe1d39b94feb8.poster.avif?t=1754682862\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/be389d4fdf8ab47a0b0fe1d39b94feb8.webm?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/be389d4fdf8ab47a0b0fe1d39b94feb8.mp4?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hit rock bottom? There's still work to be done.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your portfolio crashes and the markets turn against you, there\u2019s always a way back\u2014through hard, honest labor. Take on low-wage jobs like painting walls or collecting trash. It won\u2019t make you rich, but it might just earn you enough to get back in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/80947086129dfff91dcabd8a2d1807fb.poster.avif?t=1754682862\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/80947086129dfff91dcabd8a2d1807fb.webm?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/80947086129dfff91dcabd8a2d1807fb.mp4?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Side Hustle City, we are happy to offer you a world with lots of real-time simulations on which will depend your success, hustle your way trough it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into the in-game trading world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a real-time simulated trading app to buy and sell fictional tickers from well-known companies across the city. Track your portfolio, analyze your ROI\u2014and be careful who you trust. NPCs may offer tips and market whispers, but some insights can shift the market, others are just noise. It\u2019s up to you to tell the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/9963d8f2ea68da319878530bb7735e05.poster.avif?t=1754682862\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/9963d8f2ea68da319878530bb7735e05.webm?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/9963d8f2ea68da319878530bb7735e05.mp4?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feeling lost or out of the loop?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChirpNet is your in-game social feed\u2014where market rumors, city gossip, and breaking news collide. Stay ahead of trends, react to events, or post your own updates. But be careful... not every chirp is the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/19f43ed06c77c42e43fa3a21fd5251b5.poster.avif?t=1754682862\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/19f43ed06c77c42e43fa3a21fd5251b5.webm?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/19f43ed06c77c42e43fa3a21fd5251b5.mp4?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talk to the locals\u2014if you dare to trust them.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every store, caf\u00e9, or street corner, characters you meet have something to say. Strike up a conversation to uncover personal stories, local gossip, or even inside info about companies. But not everything you hear is reliable\u2014some tips might help you profit, while others could lead you straight into a trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/be389d4fdf8ab47a0b0fe1d39b94feb8.poster.avif?t=1754682862\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/be389d4fdf8ab47a0b0fe1d39b94feb8.webm?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/be389d4fdf8ab47a0b0fe1d39b94feb8.mp4?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hit rock bottom? There's still work to be done.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your portfolio crashes and the markets turn against you, there\u2019s always a way back\u2014through hard, honest labor. Take on low-wage jobs like painting walls or collecting trash. It won\u2019t make you rich, but it might just earn you enough to get back in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/80947086129dfff91dcabd8a2d1807fb.poster.avif?t=1754682862\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/80947086129dfff91dcabd8a2d1807fb.webm?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793120/extras/80947086129dfff91dcabd8a2d1807fb.mp4?t=1754682862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
